@startuml F0.7-a-certificado-valido
title F0.7-a — Certificado válido (GET + JWKS + ED25519.verify)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "Web Crypto API" as Crypto
participant "CertificadoController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarCertificadoUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: /publico/verificar-certificado/:hash
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET (público)
note right of Ctrl
  RateLimit por IP — RN-F0.7-10
end note
Ctrl -> UC: execute(hash)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT certificado
Postgres --> UC: metadados + assinaturaEd25519\nstatus=VALIDO
UC --> Ctrl: payload (sem GRR/e-mail)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK

WebApp -> WebApp: GET /.well-known/jwks.json
WebApp -> Crypto: SubtleCrypto.verify
Crypto --> WebApp: true
WebApp --> Verificador: selo "Certificado válido"\n+ dados do beneficiário

@enduml
